{"id":"503926","name":"鲫鱼豆腐汤","author":"羽秋青子","authorId":"11465604","desc":"","cover":"images/503926/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鲫鱼","amount":"1条"},{"name":"豆腐","amount":"2大块"},{"name":"香菇","amount":"4个（也可以不加）"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱","amount":"1根"},{"name":"姜","amount":"1小块"},{"name":"盐","amount":"2匙"},{"name":"油","amount":"3ml"},{"name":"胡椒粉","amount":"1匙"},{"name":"酒","amount":"1ml"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鱼去掉鱼鳞和内脏，洗干净","img":"images/503926/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"姜去皮，切片","img":"images/503926/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"豆腐切成一小块一小块的","img":"images/503926/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"烧热锅，放油放姜，爆香，再放鱼两面煎一下","img":"images/503926/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"差不多了，就放水，盖上锅盖，中火焖五分钟","img":"images/503926/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"再放切好的豆腐和香菇，小火焖十五分钟","img":"images/503926/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"撒上葱，就可以出锅啦！","img":"images/503926/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"是不是看起来很有食欲呢！(ง˃̀ꄃ˂́)۶。","img":"images/503926/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：汤锅、砂锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}